    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTRODUCTION:</h2><br>In MOTK: FB, you are a mercenary who finds himself, for some still unknown reason, having to face hundreds of thousands of enemies he has never faced before.<br><br>To survive, you must recruit new mercenaries, feed, equip, and train them.<br>To do this, you need to collect coins and find out what fate offers you in various loot and dead enemies.<br><br>There are TWO modes:<br>- <strong>QUICK BATTLE</strong>: play a quick game without too many worries.<br>The most powerful weapons in the game are not included in this mode, and there is only one match type.<br>- <strong>ADVENTURE</strong>: face the enemy hordes day after day to collect their loot and increasingly improve your band of mercenaries.<br>All weapons are unlocked, there are multiple mission types, you have to manage your base and craft all items, but deaths are permanent.<br>To return safely home with the loot in battle, you will have to call a portal and extract it together with your men.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERISTICS:</h2><br>- Customize the aesthetics and function of your mercenaries: model armored infantrymen, wizards, heavy knights, horse archers, crossbowmen, musketeers, ninjas, and thousands of other variations.<br><br>- 6 races: Humans, Orcs, Light Elves, Dark Elves, Dwarves, Goblins.<br><br>- 12 magical knowledge: Fire, Water, Earth, Ice, Electricity, Poison, Light, Darkness, Cosmos, Vampire, Demon, Hellfire!<br><br>- 210+ weapons, 650+ armor components, a large variety of magic items, and 4 types of mounts (horse, boar, wolf, elk)!!!<br><br>- Hire potentially hundreds of mercenaries in your group.<br><br>- You can create formations to deploy in battle.<br><br>- More than 140 different enemies!!!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE THE HORDE, GRAB THE LOOT, CROSS THE PORTAL.</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTRODUCTION:</h2><br>In MOTK: FB, you are a mercenary who finds himself, for some still unknown reason, having to face hundreds of thousands of enemies he has never faced before.<br><br>To survive, you must recruit new mercenaries, feed, equip, and train them.<br>To do this, you need to collect coins and find out what fate offers you in various loot and dead enemies.<br><br>There are TWO modes:<br>- <strong>QUICK BATTLE</strong>: play a quick game without too many worries.<br>The most powerful weapons in the game are not included in this mode, and there is only one match type.<br>- <strong>ADVENTURE</strong>: face the enemy hordes day after day to collect their loot and increasingly improve your band of mercenaries.<br>All weapons are unlocked, there are multiple mission types, you have to manage your base and craft all items, but deaths are permanent.<br>To return safely home with the loot in battle, you will have to call a portal and extract it together with your men.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERISTICS:</h2><br>- Customize the aesthetics and function of your mercenaries: model armored infantrymen, wizards, heavy knights, horse archers, crossbowmen, musketeers, ninjas, and thousands of other variations.<br><br>- 6 races: Humans, Orcs, Light Elves, Dark Elves, Dwarves, Goblins.<br><br>- 12 magical knowledge: Fire, Water, Earth, Ice, Electricity, Poison, Light, Darkness, Cosmos, Vampire, Demon, Hellfire!<br><br>- 210+ weapons, 650+ armor components, a large variety of magic items, and 4 types of mounts (horse, boar, wolf, elk)!!!<br><br>- Hire potentially hundreds of mercenaries in your group.<br><br>- You can create formations to deploy in battle.<br><br>- More than 140 different enemies!!!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE THE HORDE, GRAB THE LOOT, CROSS THE PORTAL.</h2>",
    "short_description": "Party-based rogue-lite RPG set in Earthial, a fantasy world. Hire various races of mercenaries, equip them, create battle formations, and grab the loot! Kill tens of thousands of enemies using steel and spells!",
